OL,5,G0100 Tempting Fortune
OL,6,     FAfter wading through punishing
OL,7,     Fmudflats, team spirit is sinking
OL,8,     Ffast. Who'll splash out on a
OL,9,     Fluxury cruise? And a golden
OL,10,     Fopportunity like never before pits
OL,11,     Fmorals against money...
OL,12,G0200 Taskmaster
OL,13,     FA Taskmaster legend is in the
OL,14,     Fhouse. All but one of the
OL,15,     Fcontestants enjoy a short and
OL,16,     Fsteamy train ride. And Nina Conti
OL,17,     Ftries to trick Greg Davies with
OL,18,     Fbananas and a big spoon.
