OL,5,G0300 Grand Designs
OL,6,     FKevin revisits Chris and Gill's
OL,7,     Fambitious Huddersfield mill
OL,8,     Fconversion. Has their meticulous,
OL,9,     Fperfectionist approach stood the
OL,10,     Ftest of time? And does their home
OL,11,     Fstill feel as radical today?
OL,12,G0400 Location, Location, Location
OL,13,     FIn south London, Peter and Kate
OL,14,     Fface an uphill battle to get out
OL,15,     Fof Kate's rental. And can Canadian
OL,16,     Fcouple Mel and Cody land their
OL,17,     Fperfect pad in their favourite
OL,18,     Farea?
